{"4341810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LarsGadiel", "steam_appid": 4341810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341810/extras/ff85bb7123f9487803b611590b112cdf.avif?t=1784418310\" width=529 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LarsGadiel is the prequel to Xenon Valkyrie, a game originally created for the Nintendo 8-bit console that was never released (so far). Now it finally arrives on PC with this Pixel Perfect Port.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version includes several changes that enhance the experience and make better use of the screen to display more information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341810/extras/acc279126e36ddb009729a228c3b1586.avif?t=1784418310\" width=536 height=391 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LarsGadiel is a classic Metroidvania, featuring an original retro map and level design, amazing 8-bit music, and graphics and colors faithful to the Nintendo NES.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341810/extras/4c8b516973ee5aa98777a74724190c5f.avif?t=1784418310\" width=536 height=94 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic old-school Metroidvania experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New exploration system with HUD and enhanced map for modern displays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many secrets, including some exclusive to this port.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Teleport System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple visual modes, such as Retro CRT.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added RPG elements like weapon leveling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes mechanics from modern Metroidvania titles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic chiptune soundtrack, using the original NES 8-bit sound chip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging, with labyrinthine maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox 360, Xbox One, PS4, and PS5 controllers work perfectly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on OS and version, details may vary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341810/extras/feb89380c71831b4871e37a55a57bb6c.avif?t=1784418310\" width=130 height=170 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully compatible with Steam Deck, featuring an exclusive mode for this incredible system.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341810/extras/ff85bb7123f9487803b611590b112cdf.avif?t=1784418310\" width=529 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LarsGadiel is the prequel to Xenon Valkyrie, a game originally created for the Nintendo 8-bit console that was never released (so far). Now it finally arrives on PC with this Pixel Perfect Port.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version includes several changes that enhance the experience and make better use of the screen to display more information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341810/extras/acc279126e36ddb009729a228c3b1586.avif?t=1784418310\" width=536 height=391 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LarsGadiel is a classic Metroidvania, featuring an original retro map and level design, amazing 8-bit music, and graphics and colors faithful to the Nintendo NES.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341810/extras/4c8b516973ee5aa98777a74724190c5f.avif?t=1784418310\" width=536 height=94 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic old-school Metroidvania experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New exploration system with HUD and enhanced map for modern displays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many secrets, including some exclusive to this port.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Teleport System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple visual modes, such as Retro CRT.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added RPG elements like weapon leveling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes mechanics from modern Metroidvania titles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic chiptune soundtrack, using the original NES 8-bit sound chip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging, with labyrinthine maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox 360, Xbox One, PS4, and PS5 controllers work perfectly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on OS and version, details may vary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341810/extras/feb89380c71831b4871e37a55a57bb6c.avif?t=1784418310\" width=130 height=170 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully compatible with Steam Deck, featuring an exclusive mode for this incredible system.</p>", "short_description": "LarsGadiel is the prequel to Xenon Valkyrie, a game originally created for Nintendo's 8-bit console that was never released (at least for now), but is now coming to Steam. It's a classic Metroidvania, featuring the original maps and design from that era.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341810/58197140f0a977950fa95c701cfc1133de8b3f2c/header.jpg?t=1784418310", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341810/2158552ca7f0fa30a7981815ac0f30e18147968a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784418310", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4341810/2158552ca7f0fa30a7981815ac0f30e18147968a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784418310", "website": "https://diabolicalmindgames.com/games/larsgadiel/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "All copyright and other intellectual property rights in Daniel Fernandez chavez and Diabolical Mind. <br />\r\nThis license does not affect your statutory rights as a consumer.<br />\r\nThis License is governed by Eng